 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜によると: according to (a source)",
     "texto": [
      "Put the source and add **に よると**: **てんき よほう によると、 あした は あめ です** (according to the forecast, it will rain tomorrow).",
      "**によれば** is the most formal form and is common in the news."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ということだ: they say",
     "texto": [
      "To report something you've heard from someone else: plain-form sentence + **という こと だ**: **やまだ さん は らいげつ にほん へ いく という こと だ** (they say Yamada will go to Japan next month).",
      "That way you don't take responsibility for the information."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜によれば: according to the news",
     "texto": [
      "**ニュース によれば、 ぶっか が あがった という こと です** (according to the news, prices have gone up).",
      "It's the same as **によると**, but more formal."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
